# 归一化：源码行尾一律 LF（Windows 上 clone 也不会带 CRLF 进仓）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制与快照冻结：**被 sha256 登记过、或字节形态本身是被测对象**的文件，git 不许碰
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.ttc binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.pdf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pyc binary
